 this Article. Purposes: 1. This Article assumes that transactions between professionals in a given field require special and clear rules which may not apply to a casu- al or inexperienced seller or buyer. It thus adopts a policy of expressly stat- § 2–103 UNIFORM COMMERCIAL CODE"